        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109T2248-l2tuzoigvf",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Travel to the Bolivian border and begin a two-day 4×4 journey with an English-speaking guide. Today’s route takes in Laguna Verde with views of Licancabur, the Salvador Dalí Desert, the Polques hot springs, Sol de Mañana and Laguna Colorada. Spend the night in the desert at an expedition-style hotel. Parts of the route exceed 4,000 m, where altitude sickness is possible."
